Subject: Preserve original typed function-pool categories with native slot storage
Upstream-base: a8187061af65aa2022bfd8dc2e32163089ea0090

The original four typed FunctorImpl hooks retain their reviewed Wii capture
field footprint for allocation, Clone and virtual deletion. Native physical
strides differ from source categories; counts64/512/64, delta0, threshold,
constructor, Push/Free/Pop and callable algorithms remain unchanged. Unknown
capture layouts and unsupported native footprints fail compilation explicitly.
The explicit original-function-pool profile is mandatory for the future
isolated original game module, and excludes legacy diagnostic event routing.
This patch does not add an event/game manager or establish full game startup.

